WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.770
Hello, friend.

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.078
See that button, Watch on Stremio?

00:00:03.078 --> 00:00:05.387
It's a door to another app.

00:00:05.387 --> 00:00:07.695
You decide whether to open it.

00:00:07.695 --> 00:00:10.388
Your live channels already work without it.

00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:14.808
Open Downloader and visit the official Stremio downloads page linked below.

00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:18.536
Choose Android TV, then the ARM package for your device.

00:00:18.536 --> 00:00:19.281
Install it.

00:00:19.281 --> 00:00:20.027
Open it.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:22.263
Sign in to your Stremio account.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:25.211
Back in TT tv, open My Library.

00:00:25.211 --> 00:00:27.088
Choose Sign in to Stremio.

00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:30.842
On your phone, visit the link shown on the television.

00:00:30.842 --> 00:00:32.344
Use the same account.

00:00:32.344 --> 00:00:34.972
Enter the four characters from your screen.

00:00:35.292 --> 00:00:39.054
Pick a Stremio film or episode in TT tv.

00:00:39.054 --> 00:00:40.727
Choose Watch on Stremio.

00:00:40.727 --> 00:00:42.817
Notice where you are now.

00:00:42.817 --> 00:00:45.744
Stremio handles the sources and the player.

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:51.597
To refresh your library later, choose Sync now in TT tv's Stremio account settings.

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.115
Want another source?

00:00:53.115 --> 00:00:56.310
Torrentio is an optional community add-on for Stremio.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:01:00.304
On your computer, follow the configuration link in the guide.

00:01:00.304 --> 00:01:02.301
Choose your language and resolution.

00:01:02.301 --> 00:01:05.097
Use sources you have permission to watch.

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:07.855
Real-Debrid is an optional paid service.

00:01:07.855 --> 00:01:11.512
To connect your account, choose RealDebrid in the configurator.

00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:15.575
Think of your API key as a spare house key.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.794
Keep it private.

00:01:16.794 --> 00:01:19.638
The installation link needs the same care.

00:01:19.958 --> 00:01:22.468
Choose Install, then confirm in Stremio.

00:01:22.468 --> 00:01:26.233
Reopen Stremio on the TV using the same account.

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:28.742
Try a title you can watch.

00:01:28.742 --> 00:01:31.252
Next time, start from TT tv.

00:01:31.252 --> 00:01:34.180
You already know where the door goes.

